id: SECRETS-029
title: Postmark Server Token
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
  content_contains: postmark
patterns:
  - regex: [0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}
    message: Postmark server token detected. This can be used to send transactional emails through your Postmark account.
fix: Regenerate the server token in Postmark > Servers > API Tokens. Store the token in environment variables, not in source code.
